  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint (+1), moderate (+2/+3), or strong (+4/+5) Alteration; <strong>CL</strong> 3rd (+1), 6th (+2), 9th (+3), 12th (+4), or 15th (+5)<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> neck; <strong>Price</strong> 2,000 gp (+1), 8,000 gp (+2), 18,000 (+3), 32,000 (+4), or 50,000 (+5); <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p>Extremely popular among adventurers for its protective qualities, this smooth iron neck ring is decorated with the symbol of a suit of armor on one side and a shield on the other. When worn, a necklace of natural armor provides a +1 to +5 natural armor bonus to armor class.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Alteration sphere, <strong>Cost</strong> 1,000 gp (+1), 4,000 gp (+2), 9,000 gp (+3), 16,000 gp (+4), or 25,000 gp (+5)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
